1
00:00:22,090 --> 00:00:26,040
Rain hits the same street we once knew

2
00:00:26,040 --> 00:00:32,260
Neon signs blur like your voice through the glass

3
00:00:32,730 --> 00:00:36,840
I hum the silence we used to share

4
00:00:36,840 --> 00:00:42,610
But the echo skips... like a damaged file

5
00:00:42,610 --> 00:00:44,590
You were coded into me

6
00:00:44,590 --> 00:00:47,760
Every smile, a line of light

7
00:00:47,760 --> 00:00:49,840
But now the syntax breaks

8
00:00:49,840 --> 00:00:52,800
And I can’t recompile us right

9
00:00:52,800 --> 00:00:57,690
I'm glitching where your name was saved

10
00:00:57,690 --> 00:01:02,250
In this loop, I call and fade

11
00:01:02,250 --> 00:01:06,820
My heart plays static instead of your touch

12
00:01:06,820 --> 00:01:13,860
Was love... just a corrupted patch?

13
00:01:25,200 --> 00:01:28,980
These streets remember more than I do

14
00:01:28,980 --> 00:01:34,820
Every corner flickers with what we were

15
00:01:34,820 --> 00:01:39,680
I type your name in dreams, but the field stays blank

16
00:01:39,680 --> 00:01:44,970
404... where you used to be

17
00:01:44,970 --> 00:01:47,630
No reboot, no restore point

18
00:01:47,630 --> 00:01:50,210
All the files lead back to you

19
00:01:50,210 --> 00:01:53,030
But the map is torn in neon rain

20
00:01:53,030 --> 00:01:55,390
And I walk it just to lose

21
00:01:55,390 --> 00:02:00,300
I'm glitching where your name was saved

22
00:02:00,300 --> 00:02:04,840
In this loop, I call and fade

23
00:02:04,840 --> 00:02:09,460
My heart plays static instead of your touch

24
00:02:09,460 --> 00:02:16,980
Was love... just a corrupted patch?

25
00:02:16,980 --> 00:02:21,460
Every frame of you, overwritten by time

26
00:02:21,460 --> 00:02:26,530
A shadow with no render... just light and loss

27
00:02:26,530 --> 00:02:29,550
If forgetting is healing...

28
00:02:29,550 --> 00:02:37,000
Then why does it still burn in blue?

29
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:42,050
Still glitching where your name was saved

30
00:02:42,050 --> 00:02:46,580
My system loops, but nothing plays

31
00:02:46,580 --> 00:02:51,200
I reach for code that's turned to dust

32
00:02:51,200 --> 00:02:58,760
Love was... a beautiful crash

33
00:03:19,580 --> 00:03:24,080
Neon rain keeps falling

34
00:03:26,280 --> 00:03:29,950
Your voice, lost in static

35
00:03:29,950 --> 00:03:37,680
Memory... not found

36
00:03:37,680 --> 00:03:40,020
(silence)

